Vendored verbatim from https://www.unicode.org/Public/16.0.0/ucd/Blocks.txt
Unicode Character Database, version 16.0.0 — pinned to match the UCD version
embedded in this workspace's locked `regex-syntax` 0.8.11 (its
`src/unicode_tables/*.rs` generator headers read "Unicode version: 16.0.0.",
e.g. `general_category.rs`/`age.rs`), so the block table and the `regex`
engine's own Unicode tables cannot disagree at a boundary codepoint.
Fetched 2026-09-11.